## Free tools

- [Steam Tag Analyser](https://www.immutable.com/resources/free-steam-tools/steam-tag-analyzer): free tool, paste a Steam store page for an audit of all 20 tag slots against a 725-game top-seller corpus, a reordered top five, and a 0-100 tag score; also includes an interactive genre market map plotting competition against estimated sales across ~100 Steam tags
- [Steam Capsule Analyzer](https://www.immutable.com/resources/free-steam-tools/steam-capsule-analyzer): free tool, see how a Steam capsule renders at every size players actually see (header, library, micro-trailer, big picture, discovery queue), with a 0-100 score and ranked fixes
- [Steam Festival Finder](https://www.immutable.com/resources/free-steam-tools/steam-festival-finder): free tool, paste a Steam store page to see which of 122 hand-curated Steam festivals a game is actually eligible for, checked against each festival's real entry rules (genre tags, region scope, platform requirements, pre-launch/post-launch gates) with application deadlines, a per-festival prep checklist worked back from the deadline, and .ics calendar export

